Subject: [PATCH AUTOSEL 4.14 57/89] media: saa7134: fix terminology around saa7134_i2c_eeprom_md7134_gate()
Date:   Sun, 22 Sep 2019 14:56:45 -0400
Message-Id: <20190922185717.3412-57-sashal@kernel.org>
